        1   using Progress.Lang.*.
        2   block-level on error undo, throw.
        3   class ibs.th.str.mercury.vsdstatustype:
        4     define property IsNeedCheck as integer init 0 no-undo
        5       get.
        6     define property IsErrCheck as integer init 1 no-undo
        7       get.
        8     define property IsNeedUtilized as integer init 2 no-undo
        9       get.
       10     define property IsErrUtilized as integer init 3 no-undo
       11       get.
       12     define property IsUtilized as integer init 4 no-undo
